{
  "key": 18187,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Who are you?\r",
        "My name’s Blue.\n",
        "I was once the Kanto Champion.\r",
        "Although it was short-lived thanks\n",
        "to Red...\f",
        "Anyway, take a good look around you...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Blue: A volcano erupts, and just\n",
        "like that, a whole town disappears.\r",
        "We can go on winning and losing in\n",
        "Pokémon, but if nature so much as\f",
        "twitches, we can be overwhelmed\f",
        "in a second...\r",
        "That’s the way it is...\n",
        "But, anyway, I’m still a Trainer.\r",
        "If I see a strong opponent, it makes me\n",
        "want to battle.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to battle me...for real,\n",
        "come to the Viridian Gym.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00003",
      "en_US": "I’ll be waiting for you!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to battle me...for real,\n",
        "show me how many Kanto Badges\f",
        "you’ve got.\r",
        "...\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0}...\r",
        "You’re not ready to battle me..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Blue: You are quite something!\n",
        "You defeated Red!?\f",
        "That’s great!\r",
        "Let’s take a picture together! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00006",
      "en_US": "Blue: All right!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00007",
      "en_US": "Blue: Thanks for the nice picture!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00008",
      "en_US": "Blue: Oh, well..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: I’ll never give up until the \n",
        "day I’ve rebuilt the Cinnabar Gym!\r",
        "Why not exchange numbers! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Blaine\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hmmm...\n",
        "We should be able to battle\f",
        "on Tuesday evenings!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00013",
      "en_US": "Blaine: Oh...how disappointing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Do we want to exchange\n",
        "numbers? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Oh, it is you!\n",
        "Say, do you want to take a picture\f",
        "with me right here? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00016",
      "en_US": "Blaine: There, stand next to me!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00017",
      "en_US": "Blaine: Oh, this is a good picture!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00018",
      "en_US": "Blaine: Noooo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC to delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a notice here...\r",
        "The Cinnabar Gym has relocated\n",
        "to Seafoam Islands.\f",
        "           Blaine"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0519_T09_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Cinnabar Island\n",
        "The Ravaged Town of the Past"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
